Hi guys! The journey of our little Sophia finally begins! Join Sophia the Traveler on this visual and soulful journey, and we hope our game accompanies you through a great time of delight!

In the full game, you will be able to see—

*Uniuqe picture book art style;
*Tons of very cute character assets;
*Countless fun Easter eggs;
*Vast in-game maps of the actual hand-painted Venice, featuring more than 100 European buildings, including 8 iconic landmarks, each brimming with intricate details.

Additionally, we have prepared an 80-page full-color digital comic book portraying Sophia's delightful trip to Italy! If you purchase the bundle of Sophia the Traveler: The Complete Journey, there will be an extra 10% discount. Don't miss out!

A heartfelt thank you to everyone for your support! We wish you a pleasant trip to the hand-painted Venice!

